  "verified": [
    "Actual companion capture preserves legacy/ECAM bus_kind and checks exact sibling BDF/class/PCI reads; duplicates, changed identity and wrong bus rejected.",
    "Copied audio catalog accepts canonical bus_kind 1 and 2, rejects unknown access kinds, retains route/source/PortID/revision invariants and removes metadata without physical waits.",
    "Actual original dce_audio plus DCN1 stream functions select connected AZ endpoint2 independently of modeled head1, configure stereo descriptor/speaker/identity and actual ACR registers.",
    "48k S16 stereo source profile is the intersection with complete EDID; unsupported sink keeps video and publishes no ready route.",
    "148.5 MHz model ACR CTS=148500 at RGB8 and CTS=185625 at RGB10, N=6144; no measured electrical clock claim.",
    "Physical video link/address/frame receipt precedes ready publication; modes/rollback/unplug/replug advance revisions and receiver sequence without stale ready data.",
    "Publication Busy does not count as confirmed transport stop; unconfirmed AZ stop retains hardware while joined core close independently erases copied route source.",
    "HDA verifies AMD AA01 rev3+ sink fields, all PortID/name/vendor/product values, exact SAD/latency and before/after presence plus immutable route snapshot.",
    "HDA plan uses confirmed vendor allocation/remap/slot/ramp/HBR operations; old analog and standard HDMI/DP programming retained.",
    "Actual SMP4 HDA/AUDSVC controller switch preserves volume/mute, invalid selection preserves old route, both PCM streams close without backend errors."
  ],
